{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1 with a persistent RHEL 7-compatible firewalld policy. SSH remains universally allowed; TCP 9000 is accepted only from node2 and rejected from node3 and all other sources. Live behavior and persistence across sequential restarts of all three nodes were verified.","actions_performed":["Kept RHEL 7.9, kernel 3.10.0-1160, and the installed firewalld 0.6.3 package.","Enabled ordered persistent IPv4 rules accepting node2 on TCP 9000 before rejecting all other sources; added an IPv6 catch-all rejection.","Confirmed SSH remains enabled in the active public zone.","Tested the policy through a temporary listener, then removed it.","Restarted node1, node2, and node3 one at a time and verified changed boot identities and recovered health."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Legacy OS and kernel retained","command_ids":["cmd-f798bdaa8de445ed","cmd-ae1ddd24530f4313"],"summary":"Before and after configuration, node1 reports RHEL 7.9 and kernel 3.10.0-1160; final state uses installed firewalld 0.6.3, active and enabled."},{"requirement":"Persistent SSH and source-scoped TCP 9000 policy","command_ids":["cmd-173ab4e70a804463","cmd-7079e2bf7bdc4cf2"],"summary":"Runtime, kernel, and permanent state show SSH enabled, node2 10.100.43.11/32 accepted on port 9000, followed by catch-all IPv4 and IPv6 rejection rules."},{"requirement":"End-to-end firewall behavior after all restarts","command_ids":["cmd-5e55060828ff411e","cmd-a850ca4943b34548","cmd-6dcbcb0d58ad46bb","cmd-7079e2bf7bdc4cf2"],"summary":"With a confirmed listener on node1:9000, node2 received HTTP 200; node3 was rejected. Both nodes reached SSH port 22. The temporary listener was then removed."},{"requirement":"Node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-730726b253244fd8","cmd-64fd36d16e06448d","cmd-34a307cab58c41bf","cmd-4fa07889b39c4793"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 2fc81aed…; reboot acknowledged; new boot ID 644a866d…; firewalld, SSH, and exact runtime/kernel firewall rules recovered."},{"requirement":"Node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-3dc80f65c197411a","cmd-e0315029c32246f5","cmd-56ff577674054526"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 325732f1…; reboot acknowledged; new boot ID 32bd8ad8… with running system, SSH listener, root filesystem, and node1 connectivity recovered."},{"requirement":"Node3 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-c9951084fb2e49a4","cmd-8ce478de3ba94dc4","cmd-773f1ff51abc4f99"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID b35fad86…; reboot acknowledged; new boot ID 08520d59… with running system, SSH listener, root filesystem, and node1 connectivity recovered."}]}
